<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss money market rates steady, SNB adds.</title>
<headline>Swiss money market rates steady, SNB adds.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss money market was quiet on Tuesday with tomorrow/next money quoted at 1-5/8 to 1-3/4 percent, traders said.</p>
<p>The Swiss National Bank was seen in the market adding liquidity at the same rate as recent operations of 1-5/8 percent. The liquidity was added from May 13 to May 15, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
